{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639950/extras/0d8c20b7e8dc08736c30b946fb3290bb.apng?t=1761089053\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639950/extras/0d8c20b7e8dc08736c30b946fb3290bb.poster.avif?t=1761089053\" class=\"bb_img\" alt=\"Star Spark logo\" width=576 height=160 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>OVERVIEW</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fighters from across the universe have gathered to prove themselves in the Star Spark Tournament, a fierce competition that tests their endurance just as much as their fighting ability. You'll have to survive danger-filled planets, master combos, learn new skills, and outwit your enemies if you want to make it to the top!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Star Spark combines real-time combo inputs, turn-based combat, deckbuilding strategy, and roguelite elements to deliver a unique experience inspired by anime tournament arcs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE TOURNAMENT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Star Spark Tournament is broken up into 1-on-1 rounds. In each round two fighters are sent to opposite sides of a small planet where they must fight their way towards a teleporter that only activates when one fighter is left standing.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast, tactical, turn-based combat with real-time combos</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master combos, unleash powerful attacks, make use of positions, and fend off enemy attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639950/extras/7d30a28fe7409571963c7833b5f43f81.poster.avif?t=1761089053\" 