://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639950/extras/f36199c59adb5b9ef4f7db5634f34eda.webm?t=1761089053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639950/extras/f36199c59adb5b9ef4f7db5634f34eda.mp4?t=1761089053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Highly replayable</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is a new tournament with procedurally generated routes.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639950/extras/30b94ca7d1c5080dda8300ea4e8e6f2e.poster.avif?t=1761089053\" aria-label=\"Video of different procedurally generated routes being shown.\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639950/extras/30b94ca7d1c5080dda8300ea4e8e6f2e.webm?t=1761089053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639950/extras/30b94ca7d1c5080dda8300ea4e8e6f2e.mp4?t=1761089053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcade mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete against the main cast in a ladder style tournament.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3639950?t=1761089053","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3639950?t=1761089053","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639950/f68edd7df0ac8bd3d40cd0c81fd516cd8b64b8da/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761089053","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639950/f68edd7df0ac8bd3d40cd0c81fd516cd8b64b8da/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761089053","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"